=== Scenario 12 (FABRIC TEST-NETWORK): CustodianMSP/InstalledInProductID/
=== DealerID field separation, version 3.3, sequence 8. Produced by
=== scripts/scenario_12_custodian_field_separation_live.sh against the
=== same three-organisation Fabric test-network used throughout this
=== dissertation. Unedited console output below (ANSI colour codes
=== stripped only).
===
=== This version closes a gap identified in supervisor review: the
=== single, overloaded Owner field held an MSP identity after
=== registration, then a productID after RecordAssembly, then a
=== caller-supplied dealerID after RecordDelivery. Because caller
=== authorisation compared the caller's MSP against that same field, no
=== enrolled identity could ever pass the check again once either of the
=== latter two values overwrote it -- a gap Scenario 9 had already
=== surfaced for AttachEvidence after delivery, but which also affected
=== AttachEvidence on any assembled-but-undelivered component (Part A
=== below), not previously tested.

=== 1-5. Package, install, approve, and commit v3.3/sequence 8 ===
