*** custodianMsp is "Org1MSP" -- unchanged since registration, even though
*** the component has been assembled into a product. Under the previous
*** single-Owner-field design this value would have been overwritten with
*** the literal string "CUST-PRODUCT-1" (the productID), which is not an
*** MSP and could never again satisfy an ownership check.

